## CQ-CDTX-01
@group client
@commands Full pack client with the new Creative Delight jar; JEI search `@creativeengineering canned`, `tea`, `juice`, `culture`, `dough block`; place one culture block and one dough block; `grep -n "Missing texture\|missing textures" logs/latest.log \| grep -iE "canned_\|_tea\|_juice\|culture\|dough_block"`
@pass every can, tea, juice, culture and placed block shows its own sprite (no purple-black); the grep prints nothing
@fails the jar missing `assets/creativeengineering/textures/...` (`unzip -Z1` the jar) or an old Creative Delight jar still in `mods/`
